 ### 26-Neighbor Retrieval
-1. Initialize an empty array `Neighbors` of size 26.
-2. Loop $X$ from $-1$ to $1$.
-3. Loop $Y$ from $-1$ to $1$.
-4. Loop $Z$ from $-1$ to $1$.
